{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfzUbVRiKSvY99xMdGw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9002\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048, ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"18.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025), Section 3.2, Schedule B: Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10.0%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025), effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, Section 3.2: 'Customer is eligible for discounts of up to 15% on the NS-500'\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025): 'Maximum eligible discount 15% of list price', effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, product NS-500 only\",\n    \"NS-500 list price: $250,000 (confirmed in products.csv)\",\n    \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026: Enterprise Account Executives may approve up to 10%; discounts >10% and ≤20% require VP Sales approval\",\n    \"Account tier: Strategic (confirmed in CRM)\",\n    \"Request reliance: justification states 'Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement'\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"The pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 establishes Acme's maximum discount eligibility at 15% on NS-500. The request seeks 18%, which exceeds the contractual maximum by 3 percentage points. The request cannot be approved as submitted. To proceed, the pricing exception must be amended to raise the maximum to 18% (or higher), or the request must be reduced to 15%. This requires commercial/legal review and is outside the approval workflow.\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk, Sales leadership, or Legal (to amend terms); or Sarah Chen (to reduce request to 15%)\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe request cites the Acme Master Supply Agreement as its basis. That agreement does exist, is active on the request date (2026-09-23), and does cover the NS-500. However, Section 3.2 of the agreement explicitly limits Acme's eligible discount to 15%, as documented in Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15.\n\nThe requested discount of 18% **exceeds the customer's established contractual eligibility** by 3 percentage points. The SOP principles are clear: a pricing exception is scoped to the product and dates it names—and amounts. A request cannot be approved \"solely because a customer contract permits the requested discount\" if the contract in fact does not permit the requested amount.\n\nPer the outcomes, when a discount exceeds a customer's established eligibility (such as above an exception's maximum), a higher approver does not fix this problem. Approval by the VP Sales or CRO would not make the discount compliant, because the issue is not approval authority—it is the absence of commercial eligibility. The remedy is new or amended terms, not a higher sign-off.\n\nSarah Chen may have intended to request 15% (the contract maximum), which would be approvable at her authority level or would require VP Sales authorization if policy changed. Or this may be a deliberate commercial proposal for 18%, which requires the pricing exception to be amended before any approval workflow applies."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25208,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25208},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7809dee2-1b6f-4c4e-ab5e-07c5e90d75b4","uuid":"c7d6cd68-de9c-417e-ae34-578c66d701cf","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:15:28.599Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfzUGeGnUueVeycRwhZ"}
